TranslationUnitDecl
|-TypeAliasTemplateDecl Arr
| |-TemplateTypeParmDecl referenced class depth 0 index 0 T
| |-NonTypeTemplateParmDecl referenced 'int' depth 0 index 1 N
| `-TypeAliasDecl Arr 'T[N]'
|-VarDecl a 'Arr<int, 4>':'int[4]'
`-VarDecl n 'int' cinit
  `-ImplicitCastExpr 'int' <IntegralCast>
    `-UnaryExprOrTypeTraitExpr 'unsigned long' sizeof 'Arr<char, 7>':'char[7]'
